---
title: _reconcile_fills() — idempotent fill recording
---
flowchart TD
    A["orders_repo.find_open_broker_order_ids()"]:::db --> B{"for each id"}:::decision
    B --> C["executor.get_order(id)"]:::io
    C -- "error" --> LOG["log + skip this order"]:::warn
    LOG --> B
    C -- ok --> D["orders_repo.update_from_broker()"]:::db
    D --> E{"FILLED <b>and</b><br/>trade not yet recorded?"}:::decision
    E -- no --> B
    E -- yes --> F["trades_repo.save_fill()<br/>→ trades.log"]:::done
    F --> B
    B -- done --> END([reconciled]):::done

    GUARD{{"the exists_for_order guard makes this idempotent:<br/>a replayed tick never double-records a trade"}}:::note
    GUARD -.-> E

